{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE, JUNK ARTISTS</strong> is a creative &quot;collage-and-guess&quot; multiplayer game for up to 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paintbrush, only a pile of junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skills needed, only cozy campfire vibes, boundless imagination, and joy of creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, everyone is an artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/9f7bc73c3a5776def5dd2af10228b1da.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/0bcc6cd541823922bfc99e28d2b2d262.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/0bcc6cd541823922bfc99e28d2b2d262.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/0bcc6cd541823922bfc99e28d2b2d262.mp4?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't draw? No worries! No need to draw a circle and a square at the same time\u2014 just drop a wheel or an oil barrel and you're good to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully arrange your pieces, go full abstract, or even &quot;animate&quot; materials in real-time to convey your message. With multiple collage modes and customizable word lists, it's time to test your team's chemistry and creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/27f670c1d71fbf35a1ce8014e6075889.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/5cccbde172325447058fdeda1bb91e6f.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/5cccbde172325447058fdeda1bb91e6f.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/5cccbde172325447058fdeda1bb91e6f.mp4?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outdated toys, discarded clothes, rusty metal, broken appliances...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect all kinds of junk materials to fuel your endless creative inspiration. The more ordinary the junk, the more vibrant it becomes when collaged. Even small junk can be full of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/bf7d295a2bc1d978eb82fc29b1624bb8.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/6136d058e2887c3e3059d5d4411877e1.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/6136d058e2887c3e3059d5d4411877e1.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/6136d058e2887c3e3059d5d4411877e1.mp4?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great artworks thrive on appreciation\u2014don't hold back your praise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick a red flower on your favorite artworks or cheer others with lively stickers. Psst... Each sticker triggers a unique sound effect and musical note\u2014why not turn the waiting room into a symphony? Isn't that also art?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/e4429df2a15f588c09573404c3a49ea2.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating art isn't about skills, tools, or even prompts for AI...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To us, anything born from vitality, creativity, and imagination is art. Even if you're not a professional artist, you can find joy and fulfillment here. So go ahead\u2014tinker, create, and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/98417a24f96bbe0e562fcdf65852d4c9.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/98417a24f96bbe0e562fcdf65852d4c9.webp?t=1758778343\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=193 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470550?t=1758778343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/7c7d6f225b4c345b30338c8cca571c3b5311f4f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758778343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/79dd3c77530f4eedefff49e9c0ccda88936654aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758778343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/79dd3c77530f4eedefff49e9c0ccda88936654aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758778343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>FOLLOW US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/da1c6f7732cb01aa9eaba4e909330116.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/da1c6f7732cb01aa9eaba4e909330116.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: Perfect Day Studio </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube: Perfect Day Studio </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TikTok: wejunkartists</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE, JUNK ARTISTS</strong> is a creative &quot;collage-and-guess&quot; multiplayer game for up to 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paintbrush, only a pile of junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skills needed, only cozy campfire vibes, boundless imagination, and joy of creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, everyone is an artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/9f7bc73c3a5776def5dd2af10228b1da.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/0bcc6cd541823922bfc99e28d2b2d262.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/0bcc6cd541823922bfc99e28d2b2d262.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/0bcc6cd541823922bfc99e28d2b2d262.mp4?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't draw? No worries! No need to draw a circle and a square at the same time\u2014 just drop a wheel or an oil barrel and you're good to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully arrange your pieces, go full abstract, or even &quot;animate&quot; materials in real-time to convey your message. With multiple collage modes and customizable word lists, it's time to test your team's chemistry and creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/27f670c1d71fbf35a1ce8014e6075889.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/5cccbde172325447058fdeda1bb91e6f.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/5cccbde172325447058fdeda1bb91e6f.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/5cccbde172325447058fdeda1bb91e6f.mp4?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outdated toys, discarded clothes, rusty metal, broken appliances...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect all kinds of junk materials to fuel your endless creative inspiration. The more ordinary the junk, the more vibrant it becomes when collaged. Even small junk can be full of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/bf7d295a2bc1d978eb82fc29b1624bb8.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/6136d058e2887c3e3059d5d4411877e1.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/6136d058e2887c3e3059d5d4411877e1.webm?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/6136d058e2887c3e3059d5d4411877e1.mp4?t=1758778343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great artworks thrive on appreciation\u2014don't hold back your praise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick a red flower on your favorite artworks or cheer others with lively stickers. Psst... Each sticker triggers a unique sound effect and musical note\u2014why not turn the waiting room into a symphony? Isn't that also art?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/e4429df2a15f588c09573404c3a49ea2.avif?t=1758778343\" width=616 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating art isn't about skills, tools, or even prompts for AI...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To us, anything born from vitality, creativity, and imagination is art. Even if you're not a professional artist, you can find joy and fulfillment here. So go ahead\u2014tinker, create, and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/98417a24f96bbe0e562fcdf65852d4c9.poster.avif?t=1758778343\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/extras/98417a24f96bbe0e562fcdf65852d4c9.webp?t=1758778343\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=193 /></picture></span></p>","developers":[" Perfect Day Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470550/f19b8eb2ac462f0a7008d3401cae7074a232e9fa/header.jpg?t=1758778343","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191992,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191992/movie480.mp4?t=1758767417","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191992/movie_max.mp4?t=1758767417"},"name":"pv_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191992/c53873f814d2ffea37661f5331a3cea3c14f4e2b/movie_6